      "title": "Validation can report success after silently skipping unreadable directories",
      "description": "The new command treats the result of `validateFrontmatterFiles` as a complete scan, but `discoverAllDocuments` in `packages/core/src/schema/frontmatterFileValidator.ts` catches every `readdir` error and skips that directory. If a scan directory exists but cannot be read, its documents are omitted and the command can report \u201cNo inconsistencies found\u201d with exit code 0. Limit the skip behavior to expected missing-directory errors and surface other scan failures so validation cannot give a false clean result.",
